{"Date": "04/12/2023", "Record Number": "ZCBL2023-0149", "Record Type": "Zoning Certificate Business License", "Description": "Suite #7. As Psychologists specializing in psychoeducational and neuropsychological evaluations and developmental screenings, we aim to help parents better understand and advocate for their children. We also provide IQ testing for school admissions, parent guidance consultations, and Executive Functioning Coaching. Our team is dedicated to helping children, teens, and college students to better understand themselves by providing comprehensive evaluations and personalized coaching. We want to support parents in taking the necessary steps to help their child thrive academically, socially, and emotionally. Creating a supportive environment involves a team effort: That's why we collaborate closely with schools, teachers, and therapists too.", "Project Name": "MIND MATTERS", "Status": "Approved", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "04/12/2023", "ZCBL2023-0149", "Zoning Certificate Business License", "Suite #7. As Psychologists specializing in psychoeducational and neuropsychological evaluations and developmental screenings, we aim to help parents better understand and advocate for their children. We also provide IQ testing for school admissions, parent guidance consultations, and Executive Functioning Coaching. Our team is dedicated to helping children, teens, and college students to better understand themselves by providing comprehensive evaluations and personalized coaching. We want to support parents in taking the necessary steps to help their child thrive academically, socially, and emotionally. Creating a supportive environment involves a team effort: That's why we collaborate closely with schools, teachers, and therapists too.", "MIND MATTERS", "Approved", "", "", "", "3120 TELEGRAPH Ave, BERKELEY CA 94705"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=23PLN&cap